# preview-wiki-combine-check
owner: weaver · cadence: every day at 9am · status: SUGGESTED
**Want weaver to re-render every topic wiki as one combined page on a schedule so the index/full-wiki split never creeps back?**

## Prompt
For each topic wiki, verify the preview renders a single combined index+full-wiki page and re-stage if the split (index -> get hub -> full wiki) has reappeared.

## Evidence
> there should not be a index and then a full wiki.
